    "body": "## Parent\n\n#172\n\n## What to build\n\nBring Asana to parity for completion and reopening, missing-record recovery, scheduled and manual refresh, isolated retry handling, unlinking, and explicit external deletion behavior.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Local completion and reopening are pushed to Asana and unopposed remote status changes update the canonical Task.\n- [ ] A missing Asana Task preserves the local Task and exposes Recreate and Remove link.\n- [ ] Per-Task retry, Retry all, startup, Tasks-open, local-change, five-minute, and Refresh triggers use the shared behavior.\n- [ ] Authentication failures pause retry while transient failures remain recoverable.\n- [ ] Unlinking never deletes either record implicitly.\n- [ ] Both linked-Task Trash choices and external-deletion failure behavior match the Google contract.\n- [ ] One failing Asana link never blocks another Task or provider.\n- [ ] `npm run check` is green.\n\n## Blocked by\n\n- #187 — Retry, poll, unlink, and delete Google-linked Tasks\n- #189 — Connect Asana and create a linked Task",
